\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Raw wrist PPG (BVP) signal for participant S7 during (a) sitting and (b) walking, over the same amplitude-comparable time windows. The near-periodic pulse train visible at rest is replaced by large, irregular motion artefacts once walking, with no consistently identifiable pulse structure -- the reason wrist-PPG respiration estimation during motion was not attempted in this validation.}}{5}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ppg-noise}{{3}{5}{Raw wrist PPG (BVP) signal for participant S7 during (a) sitting and (b) walking, over the same amplitude-comparable time windows. The near-periodic pulse train visible at rest is replaced by large, irregular motion artefacts once walking, with no consistently identifiable pulse structure -- the reason wrist-PPG respiration estimation during motion was not attempted in this validation}{figure.3}{}}
